@startuml CU-19
actor "Cliente" as Cli
boundary "«UI» Flutter (probador virtual)" as UI
control "«Controller» local (sensor de pose)" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» PoseService / CameraController / GarmentOverlay" as Model

Cli -> UI : 1: abrir probador virtual (variante)
UI -> Ctrl : 2: inicializar cámara (startImageStream)
Ctrl -> Model : 3: availableCameras() → CameraController
Model --> Ctrl : 4: preview activo
Ctrl --> Model : 5: InputImage por frame
Model --> Ctrl : 6: landmarks (hombros/caderas)
Ctrl --> UI : 7: puntos de pose sobre el video

Cli -> UI : 8: arrastrar/escalar prenda
UI -> Ctrl : 9: onScaleUpdate (offset + escala)
Ctrl --> UI : 10: overlay reposicionado
Cli -> UI : 11: capturar vista
UI --> Cli : 12: foto simulada con overlay

@enduml